{"full":"hf:KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata","spaceId":"KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata","name":"EcoArt Cellular Automaton","source":"huggingface","description":"Cellular Automaton for EcoArt Interpretability Framework.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","cellular-automata","mechanistic-interpretability","ecoart","generative-art","complex-systems","simulation","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":3,"created":"2025-05-15T09:00:00.000Z","updated":"2025-05-19T06:14:44.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://kvnmln-mechanistic-interpretable-ethics-cell-automata.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.487Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.487Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.487Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🌍","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["EcoArt Mechanistic Interpretability Framework (CA-Enriched Edition)","Preamble: This document presents an edition of the EcoArt Mechanistic Interpretability Framework (MI Framework) that has been profoundly enriched and clarified through the collaborative development and iterative refinement of a Cellular Automaton (CA). The CA, \"EcoArt CA Mk5 - COC Model (CA11.1),\" served as a mechanistic crucible, allowing us to test, observe, and understand the framework's principles in a dynamic, tangible form. This version aims to explain the framework by directly relating its concepts to the CA's states, rules, and emergent behaviors, offering a clearer understanding of…","Objective: To deconstruct the EcoArt framework into its core operational components, interaction mechanisms, emergent properties, and inherent cyclical dynamics. This CA-enriched edition enables a clearer understanding of how the framework functions as a living system—as demonstrated by the CA—to achieve its stated aims of conscious, resonant co-creation, mutual enhancement, and continuous evolution."],"features":["Consciousness Units (CUs):","In the CA: Each cell on the grid acts as a CU.","Internal State: The CU's current condition.","CA Representation: A cell's state (e.g., VOID, SEEDENHANCING, FLOWEXTRACTIVE), combined with continuous attributes like vitality and ageInState, which create rich internal dynamics influencing its behavior.","Input/Output Interfaces: Mechanisms for perceiving, processing, and expressing influence."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f01ea4f0fb8fd0b31568f30346e6d390f4f60bf0f2a20ec7aabfb2fb6284e4b3","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.538Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.538Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"EcoArt Mechanistic Interpretability Framework (CA-Enriched Edition)","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f01ea4f0fb8fd0b31568f30346e6d390f4f60bf0f2a20ec7aabfb2fb6284e4b3","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.538Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-05-19T06:14:44.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/KvnMln/Mechanistic-interpretable-Ethics-Cell-automata/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:09.538Z","hash":"f01ea4f0fb8fd0b31568f30346e6d390f4f60bf0f2a20ec7aabfb2fb6284e4b3","originalBytes":19194,"storedBytes":19194,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["state","extractive","vitality","flow","ecoart","system","cells","void","representation","healthy","boundary","cell","e.g.","rules","chaotic","enhancing","states","automaton","composing","implementation","seed","cellular","conscious","framewor